  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Offered to the market for the first time in over 25 years, this freehold, much-loved property is genuinely for sale. This home was architecturally designed with input from the current owners, creating a residence that was practical and built for the views. Whether you're seeking a spacious family home, accommodation for extended family, a property to renovate and add value to, or exploring future development potential, this is an opportunity worthy of your attention.\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned back from the road in a peaceful Orakei setting, this north-facing home enjoys all-day sun and captivating views across the harbour to Rangitoto Island. Offering approximately 219sqm of flexible living, the home presents a generous and versatile floor plan designed to suit a range of lifestyles.\r\n\r\nThe home features three spacious bedrooms, two and a half bathrooms, a dedicated study, and a double internal-access garage.\r\n\r\nUpstairs is the heart of the home, where the master suite enjoys the views, a walk-in wardrobe, and direct access to a sunny north-facing deck. A spacious kitchen, dining, and living area flows to an outdoor entertaining deck, creating the perfect space to relax and enjoy the outlook. This level also includes a separate guest toilet and a large office, privately positioned off the lounge, ideal for working from home, a library, or a quiet retreat.\r\n\r\nDownstairs offers excellent versatility, featuring two generous double bedrooms, one enjoying glimpses of the harbour, along with additional storage, a walk-in laundry, and internal access to the double garage. A fold-away door allows this level to be separated from the upper floor, making it ideal for extended family, teenagers, guests, or potential supplementary income opportunities.\r\n\r\nOutside, a low-maintenance paved area and easy-care landscaping provide a private space for outdoor living.\r\n\r\nWhether you choose to enjoy the home as it stands, renovate and modernise, or explore redevelopment possibilities, this exceptional property offers endless potential in a highly sought-after location.",
